  "remaining": [
    "W1: the normal development bounded-memory Start/progress/Stop/view path now shares private-boundary preparation and actual acquisition closure. Finish the qualified public entry/lifecycle and indexed transition without enabling unqualified spill; CPU/projection and failed-close session accounting, memory pressure/partial-stop, actual mixed-volume/native-device identity, package/session/domain agreement, original inventory IDs/streaming persistence, end-to-end1M/10M and every resource limit remain required.",
    "Continue native desktop qualification beyond the passing initial compact setup: Ubuntu dynamic restore/resize remains unqualified; Windows complete native input, screen-reader/theme/DPI and display changes remain open.",
    "W2: grouping/color dimensions, scoped selection/marks/baskets/hidden-mark counts and complete columns/tooltips. Indexed numeric/Name/Metadata state directions and focused-ID retention now pass all3 runtimes. Internal native acquisition/Table/link subset passes; full native pointer/a11y/theme/display/package/resource qualification remains open.",
    "W3: complete comparison charts/metric changes, saved comparisons and indexed scale; mutable private state, managed catalog maintenance/replacement/deletion, optional capped history and general import/export remain required. Named catalog/view restore and an initial offline comparison workflow are connected; no persistence gate is qualified.",
    "W0: finish raw-name fidelity/display, complete requested-component coverage and per-method qualification, source continuity and fully bounded validation/indexing. A valid data model is never live authority.",
    "W1: qualify native mount/file-bind boundaries, raw-name/case-sensitive names, sparse/compressed/resident/preallocated/fork/cloud/filesystem cases and race controls.",
    "W1: epoch refresh, native unresponsive-device and shared-memory/indexed private-store budget qualification remain. Shared eight-request actual-I/O ownership and worker cleanup now have regressions; this is not full resource qualification.",
    "Ubuntu: CLI regression coverage now passes after the other process exited. Continue process gates before every run and postpone whenever another FileCat session appears; broader native desktop, filesystem/resource and package qualification remain.",
    "W2: actual native desktop/assistive-technology testing; safe raw-name/path and unknown-value display; grouping/sort/breadcrumbs/details/tooltips; complete lifecycle and lazy tools.diskSpace registration.",
    "W4/W5: qualified live source and exact-entry typed operations, protected objects, immutable review/submission, preserving defaults and accurate outcomes. Unsupported needs feasibility evidence. Early native sharing/oplock/descriptor counterexamples are recorded; a complete qualified adapter or fully evidenced prescribed unsupported path still remains.",
    "W6/W7: declarative recipes and explicitly qualified content work; closed NTFS metadata helper or prescribed standard-scan fallback.",
    "W8: native platform/theme/DPI/a11y/package matrix, 1M/10M measurements, negative controls, actual diagnostics ZIP leakage, documentation and final requirement-by-requirement audit.",
    "After the complete implementation/testing loop: independent UX/UI/functional/security review using FINAL_REVIEW_CHECKLIST.md, fix every finding and repeat relevant native checks before completion."
